        "Content": "\nSeeking Offers in Excess of 249,000 \n\nRosemount Gardens is a development of just twelve homes and No. 11 is a semi-detached, 2 bedroom, 67 sqm bungalow.\nThis home has a nice layout with entrance hall leading into the open plan kitchen/living area. This is a triple aspect area with SW facing aspect from the kitchen, patio doors to the rear-facing garden with SW aspect, square bay window in the living area and feature open fire.\nThis home offers two double bedrooms and fully tiled bathroom.\nBallymurn is well-situated for access to Wexford Town and Enniscorthy both of which are approximately 12 km away. Blackwater village is also around 12 km and from there you have access to many beautiful beaches on the East coast of Wexford. It is also about 100 km to Bray and so is an easy commute to Dublin.\nWhether looking for a down-size home, a small family home or a bolt-hole in Wexford, No. 11 Rosemount might just fit the bill.\n67 sqm, semi-detached bungalow, SW facing to the rear, OFCH (new Grant boiler installed in 2026), mains services"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.9m x 2.1m\nLaminated flooring. Hot Press to the rear (0.9m x 0.5m)\n\nKitchen/Living Area - 7.4m x 4.5m\nTriple aspect room with square bay window to the front, open fire, laminated flooring with tiles in the kitchen area. Patio doors to the SW facing rear garden\n\nBathroom - 2.6m x 2.1m\nFully tiled, WC, WHB, bath with electric shower overhead\n\nBed 1 - 3.5m x 2.1m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nBed 2 - 3.6m x 3.5m\nwith carpet flooring\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>67 sqm semi-detached bungalow</li><li>Open plan living/kitchen/dining space</li><li>Open fire and bay window in living area</li><li>Patio access to the South West facing garden</li><li>2 double bedrooms and family bathroom</li><li>Minutes' walk to village amenities</li><li>A short drive to Wexford or Enniscorthy town and Blackwater Village</ul>"
      }
    ],
